implementation.file:
"use server"
1. Import Zod, define server-side schema (mirror client schema exactly): name: z.string().min(2) email: z.string().email() message: z.string().min(10) website: z.string().optional()
2. Export async function submitContact(prevState: unknown, formData: FormData): a. Extract fields from formData b. Honeypot check: if website field is non-empty → return { success: true } (silent trap) c. Validate with Zod schema - On failure: map ZodError to field-level error messages, return { success: false, errors } d. Call sendContactEmail({ name, email, message }) - On success: return { success: true } - On catch: return { success: false, errors: { form: "Nie udało się wysłać wiadomości. Spróbuj ponownie." } }

email-template.plain-text-fallback:
Always include a plain-text version:

---
NOWE ZAPYTANIE — mikeroe.pl
---
Nadawca: {name}
Email: {email}

Wiadomość:
{message}
---
Wysłano: {date} {time} CET
